  Facts:
  - text: "This deep-sea predator uses a glowing lure to catch its food in the dark!\nThe
      anglerfish lives in the pitch-black ocean depths. It has a built-in fishing
      rod on its head with a glowing tip called a bioluminescent lure, which it wiggles
      to attract curious prey \u2014 then SNAP! Dinner is served."
